"true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-h-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec faq" id="faq"><div class="faq-side"><span class="faq-eyebrow">FAQ</span><h2>Questions, <span>answered.</span></h2><a class="faq-all" href="/question">See all answers<svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-h-arrow-right"></use></svg></a><div class="faq-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="FAQ topics" aria-orientation="vertical"><button class="faq-tab" role="tab" id="tab-general" aria-controls="faq-general" aria-selected="true"><span>General</span><span class="mono">08</span></button><button class="faq-tab" role="tab" id="tab-free-vs-paid" aria-controls="faq-free-vs-paid" aria-selected="false"><span>Free vs Paid</span><span class="mono">04</span></button><button class="faq-tab" role="tab" id="tab-webflow" aria-controls="faq-webflow" aria-selected="false"><span>Webflow</span><span class="mono">05</span></button><button class="faq-tab" role="tab" id="tab-framer" aria-controls="faq-framer" aria-selected="false"><span>Framer</span><span class="mono">04</span></button><button class="faq-tab" role="tab" id="tab-figma" aria-controls="faq-figma" aria-selected="false"><span>Figma</span><span class="mono">02</span></button></div><div class="faq-help"><span class="faq-help-ic"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-h-chat"></use></svg></span><div><b>Still have questions?</b><p>Our team usually replies within a day.</p></div><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/contact">Get in touch<svg class="ic-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-h-arrow-right"></use></svg></a></div></div><div class="faq-main"><div class="faq-group" role="tabpanel" id="faq-general" aria-labelledby="tab-general"><details class="qa" name="faq" open=""><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">What is Flowmance?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Flowmance is a premium website template library and design studio. Templates are available across Webflow, Framer, Figma, HTML and Next.js, depending on the template, with both single purchases and full-library access.</p><p>Pick a template, make it yours and launch faster, without designing from scratch.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">What does All Access include?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>All Access unlocks every template on all five platforms (Webflow, Framer, HTML, Next.js and Figma), with 400+ designs and every new release.</p><p>You can also choose 1 or 2 platforms; from three platforms on you get all five for the same price. See <a href="/pricing">plans and pricing</a>.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">What’s inside each template?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Each template includes:</p><ul><li>Full multi-page site design</li><li>Conversion-focused responsive layouts</li><li>Reusable sections + UI components</li><li>Editable source files for Webflow, Framer, HTML, Next.js or Figma (depending on the template)</li><li>Built clean, modular & easy to customize for any brand or industry</li></ul></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Can I use the templates for client work?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes, you can use Flowmance templates for client work. You’re allowed to build unlimited personal and client projects using them.</p><p>What isn’t allowed: reselling, redistributing, or repackaging the templates in any form.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Do you support template customization?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. The Flowmance team can set up your template, add your brand and content, and design extra pages.</p><p>See <a href="/customization">customization</a> for packages and prices.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">What forms of payment do you accept?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Visa, Mastercard, American Express and Apple Pay, processed securely through Lemon Squeezy. You can pay quarterly, yearly or once for Lifetime access.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">What is your refund policy?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Digital purchases are final once payment is complete, subject to applicable law. Cancel a plan anytime to stop renewals; access continues to the end of the paid period. We suggest trying our free templates and previews beforehand to make sure Flowmance aligns with your needs.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">What happens when I cancel?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Your plan runs to the end of the period you’ve paid for, and websites you’ve already built stay live. After that you can’t start new projects with the templates. Lifetime is a single payment, so there’s nothing to cancel.</p></div></details></div><div class="faq-group" role="tabpanel" id="faq-free-vs-paid" aria-labelledby="tab-free-vs-paid" hidden=""><p class="intro">Free templates let you explore the experience. A paid plan unlocks every premium template on the platforms you pick, new ones as they launch, and a commercial license for unlimited client projects. Every plan includes the design systems of its platforms&#x27; templates (All Access: all of them), and Lifetime plans add priority support and early access to new drops.</p><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Are there free Webflow templates available?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. We offer a selection of free Webflow templates so you can test the experience. Full-library access is available through Flowmance All Access.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Are there free Framer templates available?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. We offer a selection of free Framer templates so you can test the experience. Full-library access is available through Flowmance All Access.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Are there free Figma templates available?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. We offer a selection of free Figma templates so you can test the experience. Full-library access is available through Flowmance All Access.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Are the icons and logos free?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. The 8,700+ icons (Lucide, Phosphor and Tabler) and the LogoFree logos are free with a Flowmance account: copy or download them as SVG. The icons keep their open-source licenses (ISC and MIT).</p></div></details></div><div class="faq-group" role="tabpanel" id="faq-webflow" aria-labelledby="tab-webflow" hidden=""><p class="intro">Everything you need to know about using our templates in Webflow.</p><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">How do I customize a Webflow Template?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Open the template in Webflow Designer and edit everything visually: text, colors, images, and layouts update live on screen. We use variables for spacing, fonts, and colors to make customization faster and consistent. You can also add custom code or tracking scripts in Webflow settings without breaking anything.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Are Webflow templates flexible for different industries?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. You can customize everything fast: colors, fonts, layouts, and sections. Templates work for SaaS, services, agencies, portfolios, and more. Basic Webflow skills help, but if you don’t have time, we offer customization support.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Do Webflow templates support SEO?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. They’re built with clean code, responsive structure, and fast load times, giving you a strong SEO base from day one.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Can Webflow templates be used for e-commerce?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. Many of our Webflow templates are compatible with Webflow Ecommerce. You can add products, set pricing, and start accepting payments once your site is on a Webflow Ecommerce plan. You can also connect Webflow with Shopify if you prefer using Shopify’s checkout and commerce features.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Do Webflow templates support CMS Collections?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. You can use CMS Collections for blogs, portfolios, services, careers, case studies, and more. Most Flowmance Webflow templates include CMS Collections for these, ready to fill in.</p></div></details></div><div class="faq-group" role="tabpanel" id="faq-framer" aria-labelledby="tab-framer" hidden=""><p class="intro">Your complete guide to working with Flowmance templates in Framer.</p><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">How do I edit a Framer template?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Just open the template in Framer and edit visually on the canvas. Change text, images, styles, and sections in a few clicks. The templates are flexible for SaaS, services, startups, consulting, portfolios, and multiple design styles.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Are animations editable in Framer templates?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. Framer lets you edit or remove animations easily. You can change speed, style, timing, and movement without any coding.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Are Framer templates responsive?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. Every Framer template is crafted to be responsive from the start, delivering a polished experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile with zero extra effort.</p></div></details><details class="qa" name="faq"><summary class="faq-s"><span class="faq-t">Can Framer templates be used for SaaS, agencies, and portfolios?</span><span class="faq-x" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. Framer templates work great for portfolios, agencies, and SaaS. They include modern layouts, sections for work and services, plus SaaS components like pricing, features, and dashboards.</p></div></details></div><div class="faq-group" role="tabpanel" id="faq-figma" aria-labelledby="tab-figma" hidden=""><p class="int